{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19189","headline":"令狐相公自天平移镇太原以诗申贺 · 刘禹锡","name":"令狐相公自天平移镇太原以诗申贺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北都留守将天兵，出入香街宿禁扃。\n鼙鼓夜闻惊朔鴈，旌旗晓动拂参星。\n孔璋旧檄家家有，叔度新歌处处听。\n夷落遥知真汉相，争来屈膝看仪刑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19189.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19189","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}